  "title": "Sequans Announces CFO Transition",
  "summary": "PARIS – June 2, 2026 – Sequans Communications S.A. (NYSE: SQNS) (“Sequans” or the “Company”), a leading provider of 5G/4G cellular IoT semiconductor solutions, today announced that Deborah Choate, Chief Financial Officer, will retire from the Company effective June 30, 2026, following a distinguished tenure of 19 years. The Company also announced that Norman Brodt, currently […]",
